        <h2 class="mb-1 d-flex align-items-center" style="margin-left:-0.4rem;">
            <span class="blue-ribbon-icon mr-2"></span>
            Blue Ribbon Recipe
        </h2>
        <p class="font-italic ml-3 mb-1 rcp-ugc-block">This frozen strawberry cake is a nostalgic dessert that's a must during the summer. It turns store-bought ingredients into a fantastic dessert for summer parties. Strawberry gelatin mixed with softened vanilla ice cream gives this dessert a strawberries and cream vibe. Chunks of angel food cake are also folded in. Once frozen, the texture is similar to a mousse. If you add blueberries, you'll have an easy red, white, and blue patriotic-themed dessert.</p>
        <div class="text-right small text-muted font-weight-bold">
            &mdash; <a href="https://www.justapinch.com/kitchen/crew" rel="nofollow">The Test Kitchen</a>
        </div>

